From: PureGero <puregero@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Dec 2021 16:39:52 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Reobf error with ServerPlaceRecipe

Add a comment on the loop line so the reobf mapping of the ServerPlaceRecipe
inventory iteration does not fail.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/recipebook/ServerPlaceRecipe.java b/net/minecraft/recipebook/ServerPlaceRecipe.java
index d5ce83d..d97c12c 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/recipebook/ServerPlaceRecipe.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/recipebook/ServerPlaceRecipe.java
@@ -233,7 +233,7 @@ public class ServerPlaceRecipe<R extends Recipe<?>> {
     private int getAmountOfFreeSlotsInInventory() {
         int freeSlots = 0;
 
-        for (ItemStack item : this.inventory.getNonEquipmentItems()) {
+        for (ItemStack item : this.inventory.getNonEquipmentItems()) { // MultiPaper - patch on this line to fix reobf error
             if (item.isEmpty()) {
                 freeSlots++;
             }
